# UI, UX, and Accessibility

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 Vertical slice
Dependencies: `06_MATCH_FLOW_SCORING.todo`

## Purpose

Make the game understandable from launch through rematch and ensure important state is not communicated by
color alone.

## Tasks

- [ ] Create front-end flow.
- [ ] Create input-device and team setup.
- [ ] Create match HUD.
- [ ] Create territory and bank display.
- [ ] Create pressure warning.
- [ ] Create status-effect display.
- [ ] Create pause/settings flow.
- [ ] Create results explanation.
- [ ] Create instant rematch flow.
- [ ] Add element patterns and icons.
- [ ] Add reticle, shake, vibration, and motion-effect settings.
- [ ] Add keyboard/mouse and gamepad glyph support.
- [ ] Validate UI scaling.
- [ ] Run first-match comprehension test.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] New player can start a match without developer guidance.
- [ ] Objective is understood within one match.
- [ ] Territory remains distinguishable under color-vision simulation.
- [ ] Results explain the winner.
- [ ] Rematch requires one clear action.
- [ ] Essential camera and effect settings are available.

